---
interface Props { formatLicence?: "CC0" }
const { formatLicence } = Astro.props;
---
<footer class="site-footer" aria-labelledby="footer-title">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-opening grid">
      <div class="invitation">
        <h2 id="footer-title"><span>Useful work.</span><span>Shared support.</span></h2>
        <p class="footer-lede">Two ways through the maze: develop a useful contribution, or make support easier to understand.</p>
      </div>
      <section class="club" aria-labelledby="club-title">
        <h3 id="club-title"><a href="https://citizeninfra.org/">Citizen Infrastructure Builders Club</a></h3>
        <p>CIBC builds, learns and teaches how to use tools and protocols that serve mutualism and solidarity. Tools that help communities act together.</p>
        <a class="support" href="https://opencollective.com/citizen-infra">Support CIBC on Open Collective</a>
        <p class="support-note">Support the club and explore its open finances.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-wayfinding">
      <a class="footer-brand" href="/" aria-label="ItFtI home">ItFtI</a>
      <nav aria-label="Explore ItFtI">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/itf">For builders</a></li>
          <li><a href="/fti">For funders</a></li>
          <li><a href="/fti/needs">Organisation needs</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-notes">
      <div>
        <p><a href="https://github.com/zhiganov/impact-to-funding">Impact to Funding on GitHub</a>. Its code is MIT; its original writing is CC BY-SA 4.0.</p>
        {formatLicence === "CC0" && <p>The needs spec, schema, publisher guide and fictional examples are <a href="https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/">CC0 1.0</a>. This dedication does not cover the private MCP implementation.</p>}
      </div>
      <p class="seal-note">The seal: I, t, F, t, I form the walls of a maze. Entrance at the bottom, exit at the top.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: clamp(24px, 4vw, 64px);
    background: var(--red);
    color: var(--paper);
  }
  .footer-inner {
    max-width: 1600px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: clamp(48px, 6vw, 88px) var(--pad) 32px;
  }
  a { color: inherit; }
  a:hover { color: inherit; text-decoration-thickness: 3px; }
  a:focus-visible { outline-color: var(--paper); }
  ::selection { background: var(--paper); color: var(--red); }
  .footer-opening { align-items: start; row-gap: 40px; }
  .invitation { grid-column: 1 / span 7; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 6.8vw, 6rem); line-height: 1.02; }
  h2 span { display: block; }
  .footer-lede { margin-top: 24px; font-size: var(--step-1); line-height: 1.4; max-width: 34ch; }
  .club { grid-column: 9 / span 4; }
  h3 { font-size: var(--step-2); line-height: 1.1; }
  h3 a { text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }
  .club > p { margin-top: 20px; }
  .support {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 48px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding: 0.75em 1em;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--red);
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s var(--ease-out), transform 0.2s var(--ease-out);
  }
  .support:hover { color: var(--red-deep); text-decoration: underline; }
  .support:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
  .club .support-note { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; }
  .footer-wayfinding {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px 48px;
    margin-top: clamp(48px, 6vw, 88px);
    padding-block: 28px;
    border-top: 4px solid var(--paper);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--paper);
  }
  .footer-brand { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 4rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; text-decoration: none; }
  nav ul { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  nav a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; font-family: var(--display); font-size: var(--step-1); font-weight: 700; }
  .footer-notes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; gap: 20px 48px; padding-top: 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .footer-notes p + p { margin-top: 12px; }
  .seal-note { max-width: 30ch; justify-self: end; }
  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .invitation { grid-column: 1 / span 7; }
    .club { grid-column: 8 / span 5; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .invitation, .club { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .club { max-width: 42ch; }
    .footer-wayfinding { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .footer-notes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .seal-note { max-width: 40ch; justify-self: start; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    h2 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 9vw, 4rem); }
    .footer-lede { font-size: var(--step-0); }
    nav ul { flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
    .support { max-width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
